<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN DOUBLE RESULTS (1945 GMT).</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN DOUBLE RESULTS (1945 GMT).</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Double results on the 12th day of the French Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women doubles</p>
<p>Semi-finals 5-Mary Joe Fernandez/Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat 8-Alexandra Fusai/Nathalie Tauziat (France) 3-6 6-4 6-1 1-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat 3-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)/Arantxa Sanchez-Vicario (Spain) 3-6 7-6 (7-3) 10-8 (Ends double results)</p>
</text>
